<title>HONG KONG: UDL Holdings year net down 30.2 percent.</title>
<headline>UDL Holdings year net down 30.2 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.5     vs 15.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.4	vs 4.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    71.45    vs 102.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,781.58 vs 1,633.57</p>
<p>    Company name		 UDL Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 24-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 8</p>
<p>NOTE - UDL is a marine and civil engineering company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 2.4 H.K. cents vs 4.3 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
